docs {
  # Get Feature Prices
  
  Retrieves pricing information for room type features and date-based pricing rules.
  
  ## Description
  Feature prices control dynamic pricing based on:
  - Date ranges (seasonal pricing)
  - Room type features
  - Special pricing rules
  - Demand-based adjustments
  
  ## Response
  Returns pricing configuration for different room types and date ranges.
  
  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "feature_prices": [
      {"id": 1},
      {"id": 2}
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  - This endpoint manages dynamic pricing rules
  - Prices can vary by date, season, and demand
  - Used for calculating actual booking costs
  - Essential for availability and rate management
}